  "body": "Sanitary reorganization of the repository, per maintainer request.\n\n**One documentation root.** `docs/` + `reports/` are gone. All release-closure records (matrix \u00b7 migration \u00b7 readiness \u00b7 friction ledger \u00b7 housekeeping \u00b7 baseline) now live in `documents/mantle2/`. Both machine references updated: `src/mantle/audits/invariants.py` (matrix + friction ledger paths) and `tools/build_mantle2_matrix.py` (OUT + evidence string); the deterministic matrix was regenerated (29 rows, path strings only). A dated hardcoded invariant count in the housekeeping log was reworded - the docs-vs-code gate now scans the moved files and correctly flagged it (counts derive from `mantle prove`).\n\n**Root artifacts relocated.** `Files.AppAI.spore.png` + `Files.AppAI.nest/` moved under `examples/files_appai/`; `build.py` OUTPUT and `certify.py` SPORE/NEST (+ its root-guard) updated.\n\n**Docs updated for the moves.** New `documents/README.md` corpus index (family table + Grimoire pointer). README now explicitly directs agents: read `AGENTS.md`, grok the Grimoire at `documents/grimoire/README.md` (editions there), corpus index at `documents/README.md`; repository-layout table updated. Doc-root rule in AGENTS/CONTRIBUTING/PR template simplified to the single-root statement.\n\n**Verified:** `mantle prove` 186/186 (DOCTOR-1 docs-vs-code gate re-checked), release scan PASS, grimoire SELFTEST PASS, 110/110 links resolve case-sensitively, examples/tests OK.",
